From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000001 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Q25 Build <build@localhost>
Date: Wed, 16 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] compat: Remove libmegface vendor stub

packages/apps/ParanoidSense ships its own cc_prebuilt_library_shared
for libmegface. Having both defined causes a duplicate module error:

  MODULE.TARGET.SHARED_LIBRARIES.libmegface already defined by
  hardware/lineage/compat.

Remove the stub here so the ParanoidSense prebuilt wins.

Change-Id: I0000000000000000000000000000000000000001
---
 Android.bp | 5 -----
 1 file changed, 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index 5069d3a..80a0317 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -388,11 +388,6 @@ cc_library_shared {
     vendor: true,
 }

-cc_library_shared {
-    name: "libmegface",
-    defaults: ["libMegviiFacepp_defaults"],
-    vendor: true,
-}

 cc_library_shared {
     name: "libmegskeleton",
